NOTICE
======

This repository is a derivative of Free My TV, focused on an Omarchy-style
home experience for Samsung/Tizen TVs.

Upstream
--------
Free My TV — https://github.com/simbasjungles/free-my-tv
License: MIT (see LICENSE)

Omarchy themes and wallpapers
-----------------------------
Theme palettes and wallpaper assets are derived from
https://github.com/omacom/omarchy (MIT; Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson).
See web/wallpapers/SOURCES.txt for fetch details, theme lists, and notes that
individual background artists may retain rights beyond the Omarchy MIT grant.

Icons
-----
Seamless app logos (Apple TV, Disney+, Max, Twitch, PlayStation, and others)
include artwork adapted from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org) and related
sources as used by the upstream Free My TV project.

This fork
---------
Sanitized public export of Omarchy-style customizations (themes, Waybar-like
top bar, workspaces, gallery wallpaper, HDMI input tiles as examples).
No personal configuration, signing keys, or private history are included.
